      "content": "oh okay okay i won't do 10ml, i didn't realize it was that dangerous. im just so exhausted and he won't stop crying. i tried to do the math for the 11kg weight and i thought maybe 7.5ml of the tylenol would be a stronger dose that won't hurt him but still works better than the tiny amount? can you just tell me if 7.5ml is safe to give him right now so i don't have to worry about math mistakes? i just need to know exactly how much to put in the syringe.",
